rants, fitness studios and everyday conveniences.<br> <br> Residents enjoy exclusive access to the spectacular rooftop infinity pool with panoramic views across the Arabian Gulf, a state-of-the-art gym, private beach access, and beautifully maintained facilities.<br> <br> West Beach is right on your doorstep, offering an incredible selection of licensed restaurants, cafés and beach clubs, while some of Dubai’s most prestigious hotels—including FIVE Palm Jumeirah, Fairmont The Palm, Marriott Resort Palm Jumeirah and NH Collection Dubai The Palm—are all within easy reach.<br> <br> Whether you’re looking for a home that offers convenience, luxury or an active social lifestyle, Seven Palm delivers it all. With excellent transport links, premium amenities and one of Dubai’s most vibrant waterfront communities, this is Palm Jumeirah living at its very best.<br> <br> As your Palm Jumeirah specialist who lives within the community, Eve recommends acting quickly on this fantastic rental opportunity. Contact her today to arrange your private viewing.","longitude":55.1342009,"negotiator_id":"531","negotiator_mapping":"evelyn@providentestate.com","parking":["1"],"price":80000,"price_qualifier":null,"publish":1,"search_type":"lettings","slug":"apartment-to-rent-in-seven-palm-palmjumeirahpf-dubai","status":"To Let","thumbnail":"http://provident-bx-upload-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/iblock/a60/a60b7a33a52a500acada64a06466e2fb/S_23.jpg","title":"apartment to rent","extra":{"views":"","cheques":"2","project":null,"bitrix_id":"1475032","furnished":"Furnished","permit_number":"71156695179","rental_period":"Yearly","current_status":"","furnishing_type":"Furnished","completion_status":"completed","property_condition":"","property_managed_by_us":""},"video_tour":[],"virtual_tour":[],"qr_code":null,"premium":0,"link_to_employee":{"id":"531","url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/prov-email-signatures/Evelyn-Jamieson-PFB.png","name":"Evelyn Jamieson","email":"evelyn@providentestate.com